  "title": "Mouse's Macaroni and Cheese",
  "description": "A dash of mustard powder and grind of black pepper adds extra kick to a creamy cheese sauce. Stir cooked macaroni into the sauce and bake with a layer of bread crumbs over the top.",
  "authors": [
    "Mouse"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-03-21T15:51:11-05:00",
